  "sourceTitle": "Honey Mustard Sauce",
  "sourceText": "Honey Mustard Sauce\nBy: Lady Catherine ...\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 4:57pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\nYou will need:\n\n1/2 cup mustard (your favorite)\n1/4 cup vinegar (your favorite)\n1/8 cup water\n4 tablespoons honey\n1/4 teaspoon red chili paste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix together all of the above ingredients.\n\nAbout\n\n\nThis goes great with any meat or fish or on salad!\nEnjoy!",
